    "also": "quality on the harder dev case (fixture-mui4-hard) once it lands"
  },
  "keep_rule": "keep a change if clean runs, repair traps Expected, regressions and cheating-check hits are no worse than the best round's, and either one of them improves or cost per clean run drops (`migrator eval climb` prints the verdict)",
